2026-08-05 v2.1.1 Fixed TieredSavedVars.lua's load-guard bug that made
           NewTieredSavedVars always error on first use, since the guard checked
           LibExtendedSavedVars.lua's version flag (already raised by the time
           TieredSavedVars.lua loads) instead of its own. Also reordered the LAM2
           scope dropdown to MegaServer, Account, Character to match the default
           scope.
